{
    "chapter_num": 22,
    "verses_count": 46,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Parable of the Wedding Feast"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Jesus answered and spoke to them again by parables and said: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“The kingdom of heaven is like a certain king who arranged a marriage for his son,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "and sent out his servants to call those who were invited to the wedding; and they were not willing to come."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Again, he sent out other servants, saying, ‘Tell those who are invited, “See, I have prepared my dinner;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "my oxen and fatted cattle are killed, and all things are ready. Come to the wedding.” ’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "But they made light of it and went their ways, one to his own farm, another to his business."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "And the rest seized his servants, treated them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "insolently"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "spitefully, and killed them."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "But when the king heard about it, he was furious. And he sent out"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "his armies, destroyed those murderers, and burned up their city."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Then he said to his servants, ‘The wedding is ready, but those who were invited were not"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "worthy."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Therefore go into the highways, and as many as you find, invite to the wedding.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "So those servants went out into the highways and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "gathered together all whom they found, both bad and good. And the wedding hall was filled with guests."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“But when the king came in to see the guests, he saw a man there"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "who did not have on a wedding garment."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "So he said to him, ‘Friend, how did you come in here without a wedding garment?’ And he was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "speechless."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Then the king said to the servants, ‘Bind him hand and foot,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits take him away, and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "take him away, and cast him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "into outer darkness; there will be weeping and gnashing of teeth.’"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“For many are called, but few are chosen.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Pharisees: Is It Lawful to Pay Taxes to Caesar?"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the Pharisees went and plotted how they might entangle Him in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "His"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " talk. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they sent to Him their disciples with the Herodians, saying, “Teacher, we know that You are true, and teach the way of God in truth; nor do You care about anyone, for You do not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. look at the face of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "regard the person of men. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Tell us, therefore, what do You think? Is it lawful to pay taxes to Caesar, or not?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But Jesus "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "knew"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "perceived their wickedness, and said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Why do you test Me, you hypocrites?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Show Me the tax money.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So they brought Him a denarius."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Whose image and inscription is this?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "They said to Him, “Caesar’s.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Render"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Pay"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "therefore to Caesar the things that are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Caesar’s, and to God the things that are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "God’s.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When they had heard "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "these words,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " they marveled, and left Him and went their way."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Sadducees: What About the Resurrection?"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The same day the Sadducees, who say there is no resurrection, came to Him and asked Him, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "saying: “Teacher, Moses said that if a man dies, having no children, his brother shall marry his wife and raise up offspring for his brother. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now there were with us seven brothers. The first died after he had married, and having no offspring, left his wife to his brother. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Likewise the second also, and the third, even to the seventh. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Last of all the woman died also. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, in the resurrection, whose wife of the seven will she be? For they all had her.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jesus answered and said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“You are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "deceived"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "mistaken,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "not knowing the Scriptures nor the power of God."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "For in the resurrection they neither marry nor are given in marriage, but"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "are like angels"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits of God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "of God in heaven."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "But concerning the resurrection of the dead, have you not read what was spoken to you by God, saying,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘I am the God of Abraham, the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob’? God is not the God of the dead, but of the living.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when the multitudes heard "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "this,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " they were astonished at His teaching."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Scribes: Which Is the First Commandment of All?"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But when the Pharisees heard that He had silenced the Sadducees, they gathered together. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then one of them, a lawyer, asked "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Him a question,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " testing Him, and saying, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Teacher, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the great commandment in the law?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jesus said to him, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“‘You shall love the Lord your God with all your heart, with all your soul, and with all your mind.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "This is the first and great commandment."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 39,
                    "num_str": "39",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "And the second is like it:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘You shall love your neighbor as yourself.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 40,
                    "num_str": "40",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "On these two commandments hang all the Law and the Prophets.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus: How Can David Call His Descendant Lord?"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 41,
                    "num_str": "41",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "While the Pharisees were gathered together, Jesus asked them, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 42,
                    "num_str": "42",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "saying, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“What do you think about the Christ? Whose Son is He?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "They said to Him, “"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "The"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Son"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of David.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 43,
                    "num_str": "43",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“How then does David in the Spirit call Him ‘Lord,’ saying:"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 44,
                    "num_str": "44",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘The"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Lord said to my Lord,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Sit at My right hand,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Till I make Your enemies Your footstool” ’?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 45,
                    "num_str": "45",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "If David then calls Him ‘Lord,’ how is He his Son?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 46,
                    "num_str": "46",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And no one was able to answer Him a word, nor from that day on did anyone dare question Him anymore."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}